        "original_id": "1c5660ff-5b40-5920-8ac7-f685a0cfc5d0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Corey Gibson, Corey Chorus, Rihanna, Dan Balan, Demi Lovato\n- Roles: songwriter, record producer, vocal producer, sound engineer, publisher, recording artist\n- Songs: \"Cheers (Drink to That)\", \"Chica Bomb\", \"Made in the USA\"\n- Albums: Loud\n\nFacts:\n- Corey Gibson is professionally known as Corey Chorus.\n- Corey Chorus is an American songwriter, record producer, vocal producer, sound engineer, and publisher.\n- Corey Chorus is known for writing the songs \"Cheers (Drink to That)\" by Rihanna, \"Chica Bomb\" by Dan Balan, and \"Made in the USA\" by Demi Lovato.\n- Rihanna is a Barbadian recording artist.\n- \"Cheers (Drink to That)\" is a song recorded by Rihanna.\n- \"Cheers (Drink to That)\" appears on Rihanna's fifth studio album, \"Loud\".\n- \"Loud\" was released in 2010.",
